<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T cut by Prudential.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T cut by Prudential.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it downgraded AT&amp;T Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 4-7/8 to 52-3/8 in heavy trading after AT&amp;T warned that competition in its key long-distance market would hurt second-half results.</p>
</text>
